          "text": "US Central Command launched attacks targeting Iranian air defense sites, radar systems, maritime assets, and mine laying capabilities.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-iran-strategy-could-this-become-a-forever-war/a-78875030?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Jordan reported detecting 13 ballistic missiles in its airspace, 10 of which it intercepted.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "DW World",
          "url": "https://www.dw.com/en/trump-s-iran-strategy-could-this-become-a-forever-war/a-78875030?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
